Package: neuralplsi
Type: Package
Title: Neural Network Partial-Linear Single-Index Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hyungrok", "Do", email = "hyungrok.do11@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits partial-linear single-index models g(x'beta) + z'gamma for
    continuous, binary and right-censored time-to-event outcomes, with a
    neural-network link g ('NeuralPLSI', Do, Wang, Liu and Lee (2025)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2512.11593>) or a B-spline link ('SplinePLSI', Wang et
    al. (2020) <doi:10.1186/s12940-020-00644-4>), and pairs-bootstrap inference
    on native threads. Fitting, prediction, the bootstrap and model files use
    the same C++ engine as the Python package 'neuralplsi', so both give
    identical results on the same machine.
